      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وسّدهُ وِسَادًا</span></b> , or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وِسَادَةً</span>, (L, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَيْئًا</span>, (S,)
<i>He put a pillow,</i> (L, K,) and <i>a thing,</i> (S,)
<i>beneath his</i> (<i>another's</i>) <i>head.</i> (S, L, K *.) [See
an ex. in a verse cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَنُوبٌ</span>: and another
voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوَادٌ</span>.]

